    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Lawrence Meeks joined Prince Doran's spy network the same year he arrived in New Orleans (1805) and ran it from 1830 to 1885. Convinced @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.UhaIbwzsC1O2x9vr]{Nosferatu} made the best spies, he created three childer &mdash; Avery, Roger, and Martin &mdash; specifically to staff it, and eventually handed leadership to his most gifted childe, Martin. Lawrence retired to the French Quarter and later moved to Baton Rouge during World War II, where he now sits as Prince of a domain with barely a handful of resident Kindred. His real power comes from the decades of secrets he accumulated while running Doran's network and from his former membership in the Web, an international @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.UhaIbwzsC1O2x9vr]{Nosferatu} intelligence consortium he can still call on in a pinch; some Kindred whisper he played a hand in Marcel's rise to power, and others claim he deals with the Black Spiral Dancers.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Unusually talkative for a Nosferatu &mdash; you love good conversation and will dole out tantalizing scraps of New Orleans' secrets to keep a good listener from leaving, though real information is never bought or traded outright.</p><p><strong>Disciplines (as printed, dot-rating, converted to owned Discipline Items on this Actor at Storyteller discretion):</strong> Animalism 4, Auspex 4, Dominate 3, Fortitude 2, Obfuscate 5, Potence 3.</p>",
    "notes": "Sire: Warwick. Childer: Avery, Roger, Martin (Martin now heads New Orleans' spy network). Former member of the Web, an international @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.UhaIbwzsC1O2x9vr]{Nosferatu} intelligence network. Haven: the Old State Capitol in Baton Rouge. Secrets rating: A.",
    "npcType": "vampire"
  },
